    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan advances heavenly web Gu to rank nine. The rank nine Gu carries a cobweb-like white insignia on its back that rank eight heavenly web Gu does not have. Activated by itself, heavenly web Gu releases a giant web to trap the target, so strictly it is not a defensive Gu but an offensive one, though it stays the core of the defensive killer move heavenly web protection veil, whose power rises massively at rank nine, and it can also be used inside obscured heavenly secret to strengthen that move. Fang Yuan wants an Immortal Gu that helps in frontal offense and defense, and between the two he picks defense without hesitating, because the non-conflicting dao marks of his sovereign immortal body leave that side of him extremely weak.",
        "chapters": [
          2306
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-advance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_defensive_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It looks like a crystal spider, clear and transparent with no flaws. Its eight legs are slim and long, and its small body is raised high on those legs.",
        "chapters": [
          2227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Told to defend while Fang Yuan attacks, Paradise Earth activates heavenly web protection veil against Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s golden light rays, and the milky white web blocks them completely; the fight is in the void, where no outside luck path dao marks amplify Giant Sun Immortal Venerable.",
        "chapters": [
          2203
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paradise-earths-defense-in-crazed-demon-cave",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Paradise Earth activates the move again and Fang Yuan gains a brief respite, and Zhan Bu Du and Qi Sea Ancestor arrive to reinforce him as the two venerables break the heavenly web.",
        "chapters": [
          2205
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paradise-earths-defense-in-crazed-demon-cave",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_zhan_bu_du",
          "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Facing Star Constellation Immortal Venerable, Fang Yuan secretly lets the milky white web of heavenly web protection veil flow into the thin fishing net obscured heavenly secret has formed, so one net carries both moves; heavenly web Gu is a rank nine Immortal Gu, and heavenly web protection veil’s defensive power is higher than Mental Domain’s killer move. After a few exchanges, Star Constellation Immortal Venerable forces Fang Yuan to use his rank nine heavenly web Gu, adding a heavy burden onto obscured heavenly secret.",
        "chapters": [
          2309
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-use-against-the-three-venerables",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
          "loc_mental_domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Heavenly web protection veil is one of Fang Yuan’s recent gains, and he uses it because he feels it suits the situation.",
        "chapters": [
          2310
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-use-against-the-three-venerables",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He cancels reverse flow protection seal and relies on obscured heavenly secret merged with heavenly web protection veil to endure Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s attack while rushing at Star Constellation Immortal Venerable.",
        "chapters": [
          2311
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-use-against-the-three-venerables",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan defends himself with heavenly web protection veil, which is a genuine rank nine killer move carrying the amplification of his heaven path dao marks, and its merger with obscured heavenly secret thwarts Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s investigative methods.",
        "chapters": [
          2313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-use-against-the-three-venerables",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Maintaining heavenly web protection veil alongside heavenly ghost concealment taxes Fang Yuan’s thoughts heavily, and holding it with Cooking Luck Pot keeps his luck clear of Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s luck path killer move, which strips Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s own luck defenses away.",
        "chapters": [
          2314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-use-against-the-three-venerables",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_cooking_luck_pot"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Heavenly web protection veil, together with obscured heavenly secret, keeps supporting Fang Yuan secretly, and he gains the upper hand until Star Constellation Immortal Venerable and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable join hands to match him.",
        "chapters": [
          2320
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-use-against-the-three-venerables",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
